cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the paper."
title: "Certified bounds for the transmission-line-matrix method"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation of a guaranteed two-sided error bound for the
  transmission-line-matrix method, obtained by realising a Prager-Synge
  complementary pair with the two dual TLM diffusion networks, together with
  the certified three-dimensional capacitance extraction and the
  geometric-error experiments reported in the accompanying paper.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Talleb
    given-names: Hakeim
    affiliation: "Sorbonne Universite, CNRS, Laboratoire de Genie Electrique et Electronique de Paris (GeePs), Paris, France"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-2734-6242"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/tallebhakeim/tlm-certified-bounds"
keywords:
  - certified bounds
  - complementary variational principles
  - transmission-line matrix method
  - Prager-Synge
  - capacitance extraction
  - geometric error
